### Terraform (phase 7) ###
# Provider binaries - large, re-downloadable
.terraform/
# State contains secrets in PLAINTEXT. Never commit.
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log
# Variable files often hold credentials
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!example.tfvars
# NOTE: .terraform.lock.hcl is deliberately NOT ignored - it must be committed.
